    family-names: Atalay
    email: sina.atalay@academa.ai
    affiliation: Academa, Inc.
    orcid: https://orcid.org/0009-0000-4969-8604
  - given-names: Abdullah
    family-names: Geduk
    email: geduk@academa.ai
    affiliation: Academa, Inc.
    orcid: https://orcid.org/0009-0002-1154-1542
repository-code: https://github.com/academa-labs/manimgx
url: https://manimgx.academa.ai/
license: MIT
keywords:
  - animation
  - manim
  - mathematics
  - gpu
  - typst
  - visualization
# the works ManimGX builds on, under the titles and authors their own CITATION.cff files give;
# 3Blue1Brown's manim has none, so it is cited by its repository's name and its package's
# author. ManimGX has Manim CE's API, and source ported from CE 0.21: the version cited, with
# its Zenodo DOI. CE was forked in 2020 from 3Blue1Brown's manim, before ManimGL, its OpenGL
# rewrite. Typst is compiled into the engine and sets every text. Their licenses are in
# LICENSE-THIRD-PARTY.
